# Force LF line endings for everything in the repo, regardless of any
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a shell script
# committed from Windows can pick up CRLF line endings, which breaks with
# "bad interpreter" errors when run on macOS/Linux (e.g. by
# install_watcher_launchagent.sh) -- exactly the platform this repo is
# being deployed to.
* text=auto eol=lf
